<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS11" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Optimal Scaling Needs Optimal Norm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11 </span>Ablations on Fig. <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS11.SSS1" title="In A.11 Ablations on Fig. ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Optimal Scaling Needs Optimal Norm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11.1 </span>Momentum &amp; learning rate decay</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS11.SSS2" title="In A.11 Ablations on Fig. ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Optimal Scaling Needs Optimal Norm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11.2 </span>Norm choice</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS12" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Optimal Scaling Needs Optimal Norm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12 </span>Learning rate layout for additional batch sizes and horizons</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS13" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Optimal Scaling Needs Optimal Norm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.13 </span>Individual norm scans and fits</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
