<span id="A1.F14.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(a)</span> For <math id="A1.F14.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lVert{\bm{W}}_{\mathrm{out}}\rVert_{\mathrm{RMS}\to\mathrm{RMS}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>out</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>RMS</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>RMS</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lVert{\bm{W}}_{\mathrm{out}}\rVert_{\mathrm{RMS}\to\mathrm{RMS}}</annotation></semantics></math> (output layer).
<span id="A1.F14.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(b)</span> For <math id="A1.F14.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lVert{\bm{W}}_{\mathrm{in}}\rVert_{\mathrm{1}\to\mathrm{RMS}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>in</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>RMS</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lVert{\bm{W}}_{\mathrm{in}}\rVert_{\mathrm{1}\to\mathrm{RMS}}</annotation></semantics></math> (input layer).</figcaption>
